                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Sh_{q(U)}(\mathcal{E})
            are the double negation subtoposes
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi Sh
                    %mrow
                      %mo ¬
                      %mo ¬
