                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Sh_{c(U)}(\mathcal{E})
            corresponding to the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/subterminal+object"} subterminal object
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
