                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{E}_{c(U)} \subseteq \mathcal{E}_{c(U')}
            restricts to the double-negation subtoposes if and only if it is
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/skeletal+geometric+morphism"} skeletal
            %a{:href => "#Johnstone"} Johnstone, Lemma D4.6.10
            requires that the exterior of the corresponing Lawvere-Tierney topology in
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi ℰ
                    %mrow
                      %mi c
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
